<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Altera raised by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Altera raised by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Altera Corp to near-term accumulate from neutral and maintained its long-term accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Wednesday at 53-7/8.</p>
